stream
<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">i took a leap of faith (i should've stayed asleep instead)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Adora only remembers fragments from the Northern Reach. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;One moment Catra was on the ground, and then red. And then pain. Shooting through her skull, so much that she couldnâ€™t focus on anything else. And then, nothing. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Well, not &lt;i&gt;nothing&lt;/i&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She remembers attacking her friends. Glimmer popping in and out of existence, Bow with an unsteady grip on his tool. Catra on the ground again, face adorned with an expression of terror. And Adora swears that she can remember herself, sword in hand, about to strike down, &lt;i&gt;laughing&lt;/i&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;--&lt;br /&gt;Or: The mission to the Northern Reach affected Adora more than anyone realized. Believing herself to be a danger to her friends, she flees.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>grasstalker</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
